

Matrices obtained using Matrix Population Models
See Fréville et al. 2000 Ecology
and Hadjou Belaid et 2018 for details


matrice_globale.Rdata : matrice pooling data over year and populations

matricesperyear.Rdata : 27 matrices (one per year) pooling populations

and Aumatrices.Rdata : 27 matrices (one per year) for Auzils populations... and so for each of population (6 datasets)




